     "finding": "54 recovered inputs: all 14 Finger Table I rows (293 K, original ruby scale), all 21 Hemley Table I rows (300 K, Fei-stated revised ruby scale), 13 separable new Figure5 cold markers and six 1000 K hot markers on published Fei Pt scale. Original complete new observations, paired calibrant volumes, fitting weights and covariance are absent. The unweighted 54-point joint fit reaches coefficient parity for K0, K0-prime and q within individual published error widths. Exact original-regression recovery and absolute accuracy are not established."
